{"5161940": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Home Reset: Organizing Simulator", "steam_appid": 5161940, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Home Reset: Organizing Simulator</i> is a relaxing first-person game about turning messy rooms into clean, comfortable spaces. Pick up scattered objects, decide where they belong, and arrange every room exactly the way you like. There are no strict rules—you are free to organize items neatly, decorate creatively, or create a perfectly imperfect home filled with personality. As you progress, unlock helpful abilities that make organizing faster and more satisfying, including carrying multiple objects and interacting from a greater distance. Open drawers, discover hidden items, rotate objects, and find the perfect place for everything. Transform cluttered houses into warm, cozy homes while enjoying a peaceful experience at your own pace. Every room is your canvas, and every object is yours to place.<strong> </strong><br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5161940/extras/8849782eed9ac6d884b110a3ba4d86f7.avif?t=1788339030\" width=610 height=99 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5161940/extras/b0589585cf4b7853451c320b6ebe3b12.poster.avif?t=1788339030\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5161940/extras/b0589585cf4b7853451c320b6ebe3b12.webm?t=1788339030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5161940/extras/b0589585cf4b7853451c320b6ebe3b12.mp4?t=1788339030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img